# Local env files must never be uploaded — Vercel's own dashboard-managed env vars are the
# source of truth for deployments. (`vercel deploy` otherwise happily bundles these and their
# values silently override the real ones, e.g. NEXTAUTH_URL=localhost broke every prod redirect.)
.env
.env.local
.env.development
.env.development.local
.env.production.local
.env*.local
